        {
          "text": "Maono higa gosi gakakala dza chitabu chiricho fungbwa na muhuri. Uchimupha mutu amanyaye kusoma anaamba, “Siweza kuchisoma mana china muhuri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
